  "description": "This project involves migrating and improving an existing technical documentation site using Mintlify. We are restructuring the documentation into clear, user-focused sections, improving navigation and readability, and using Mintlify's GitHub-based workflow to manage and publish changes. We will also evaluate alternative documentation platforms, explore Mintlify's AI capabilities, and demonstrate how the published documentation can be accessed through MCP.",
